WEBVTT

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:39.414
The path is secure.

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:42.709
It seems we're a good distance
from the contaminoids.

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:48.298
I'm having our nen'i operators
keep a perimeter guard just in case...

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:50.633
but I'm sure we are in the clear.

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:52.427
Just what is going on?

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.929
Why has Zuellni suddenly begun moving?

00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:56.556
What of the electronic spirit?

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.142
There is no sign it has returned
to the machinery department.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:02.228
So the Fallen One's no longer an influence?

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.439
It's moved away from Zuellni?

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:06.816
That we don't know.

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:08.777
What on earth happened?

00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:12.655
Nina Antalk has returned.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:15.408
No...

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.619
I am over-thinking this.

00:01:20.997 --> 00:01:24.125
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:27.671
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:01:27.671 --> 00:01:35.095
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:40.809
<i>Chizu o ushinatte samayotteiru machi</i>

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:44.270
<i>Owariyuku sekai demo</i>

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:50.985
<i>Karada no oku de hashiru</i>
<i>no o yamenai inochi o kikasete</i>

00:01:50.985 --> 00:01:54.280
<i>Tayasanai hikari o tozasanai hitomi ni</i>

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.659
<i>Kawaitemo yakitsuketa</i>

00:01:57.659 --> 00:02:04.290
<i>Kizutsuku koto mo naku</i>
<i>te ni suru mono nante nanimo shinjinai</i>

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:10.213
<i>Dareka ni mukatta hitosuji no omoi wa</i>

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:18.054
<i>Yoake no you ni hagane no yami o kirisaku</i>

00:02:18.054 --> 00:02:22.392
<i>Itsuka brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:26.062
<i>Dakara tsuyoku kaeru</i>

00:02:26.062 --> 00:02:32.027
<i>Kasaneta chikara mo inori mo</i>

00:02:32.027 --> 00:02:35.697
<i>Kousa suru mirai, kakaeta negai</i>

00:02:35.697 --> 00:02:39.117
<i>Dare no te ni mo watasenai</i>

00:02:39.117 --> 00:02:40.660
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:45.665
<i>Kokoro o tsuraneru</i>

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:11.107
Thank you very much.

00:03:11.107 --> 00:03:12.817
Nina! How'd it go?!

00:03:12.817 --> 00:03:16.112
Good. Nothing out of the ordinary, apparently.

00:03:16.112 --> 00:03:19.324
Really? Thank goodness.

00:03:20.575 --> 00:03:22.827
I'm sorry for making you all worry.

00:03:22.827 --> 00:03:26.414
Nah, we ain't so concerned about that.

00:03:26.414 --> 00:03:29.417
You have yet to tell us anything!

00:03:30.669 --> 00:03:34.422
I and the others
looked all throughout Zuellni...

00:03:34.422 --> 00:03:37.967
but we couldn't find you.

00:03:37.967 --> 00:03:40.512
I heard that you suddenly
appeared out in the wilds

00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:43.223
while we were fighting the contaminoids.

00:03:43.223 --> 00:03:47.143
Is it true? Why did this happen?

00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:50.855
I'm sorry.

00:03:50.855 --> 00:03:53.483
You're saying you can't talk about it?

00:03:53.483 --> 00:03:55.694
What about to the student council president?

00:03:56.528 --> 00:04:01.116
I don't know how to say it myself...

00:04:01.116 --> 00:04:02.909
I know that's a selfish excuse.

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:04.911
I understand your distrust.

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:07.914
But I will definitely find the words to explain it.

00:04:07.914 --> 00:04:10.458
So for now...

00:04:10.458 --> 00:04:12.377
let me...

00:04:12.377 --> 00:04:14.212
let me...

00:04:27.642 --> 00:04:31.104
"The Night Before the Intermunicipal Battle"

00:04:31.396 --> 00:04:32.605
Do you believe her?

00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:36.901
She says she can't talk about it.
There must be some reason.

00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:38.987
You were childhood friends, weren't you?

00:04:38.987 --> 00:04:41.281
That's not why I'm...!

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:43.783
She's not clever enough to be able to lie.

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:45.785
Not our leader.

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:49.414
I don't think you're clever enough to comment.

00:04:49.414 --> 00:04:50.832
Huh?

00:04:51.666 --> 00:04:52.459
Nothing at all.

00:04:52.459 --> 00:04:53.918
What do you mean, "Nothing at all"?

00:04:53.918 --> 00:04:55.962
If I say "nothing at all," it means nothing at all!

00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:57.797
It's not "nothing at all" at all, is it?

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.674
You're annoying!

00:05:00.508 --> 00:05:04.554
Everyone is relieved that you're unhurt, ma'am.

00:05:04.554 --> 00:05:07.182
I see. Sorry...

00:05:07.182 --> 00:05:09.100
Not at all.

00:05:10.185 --> 00:05:13.855
I sort of have an errand. I'll just be...

00:05:13.855 --> 00:05:16.941
Of course. Please get some rest.

00:05:17.734 --> 00:05:19.652
See you tomorrow!

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:21.780
Layfon!

00:05:22.822 --> 00:05:28.870
I think I'm the one who's happier
to be back here with all of you.

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:45.178
Layfon Alseif.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:07.951
It appears a letter from Glendan
arrived early this morning.

00:06:07.951 --> 00:06:13.164
Glendan? From Her Majesty? What did it say?

00:06:13.164 --> 00:06:18.044
I don't know. Haia crumpled
it up after reading it.

00:07:16.895 --> 00:07:22.317
Ah. So Derk's disciple became
a Keeper of the Heaven's Blade.

00:07:23.526 --> 00:07:26.029
Layfon Alseif...

00:07:26.029 --> 00:07:28.031
It is a good name.

00:07:49.177 --> 00:07:50.804
Dinn.

00:07:51.596 --> 00:07:57.435
I... am the same as you. What should I do?

00:07:57.435 --> 00:08:00.271
Tell me, what should I do?

00:08:01.106 --> 00:08:02.732
Dinn!

00:08:40.854 --> 00:08:42.480
Restoration!

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:01.541
Fire Kei, Great Projectile Flash!

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:05.211
Go!

00:09:21.102 --> 00:09:23.897
You used up too much energy.
You'd have lasted a bit longer

00:09:23.897 --> 00:09:25.982
if you'd released your <i>kei </i>normally.

00:09:25.982 --> 00:09:26.941
Shut up!

00:09:26.941 --> 00:09:31.279
Today will be impossible.
Should we try again tomorrow?

00:09:32.113 --> 00:09:35.241
Uh... Of course!

00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:36.701
I'm sorry.

00:09:36.701 --> 00:09:37.577
Not at all.

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:40.497
Honestly... It was a little unexpected.

00:09:40.497 --> 00:09:43.833
Asking you to help with Shante's training?

00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:46.294
I determined that would be the best route.

00:09:46.294 --> 00:09:47.253
That's all.

00:09:47.253 --> 00:09:49.547
I'm only training because Gor told me to!

00:09:49.547 --> 00:09:52.801
I don't accept you! Not... at all.

00:09:55.512 --> 00:10:01.267
Last time... It was around now,
when the competitions ended.

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:02.727
An intermunicipal battle?

00:10:02.727 --> 00:10:06.773
We have to do everything we can.

00:10:06.773 --> 00:10:08.483
It's just as you said...

00:10:08.483 --> 00:10:11.319
Her <i>kei </i>power is formidable.

00:10:11.319 --> 00:10:13.780
Yeah. Maybe greater than mine.

00:10:21.329 --> 00:10:23.707
Found you. What are you doing?

00:10:23.707 --> 00:10:25.542
Perfect timing.

00:10:25.542 --> 00:10:27.627
I'd like to ask you about something.

00:10:27.627 --> 00:10:32.173
It would appear you're
thinking of something unseemly.

00:10:32.173 --> 00:10:34.551
The letter from Her Majesty?

00:10:34.551 --> 00:10:39.514
"I will send a Sword there.
Leave the rest to that Sword."

00:10:39.514 --> 00:10:40.765
That's what it said.

00:10:40.765 --> 00:10:43.351
A Keeper of the Heaven's Blade
is coming to Zuellni?

00:10:43.351 --> 00:10:46.771
They plan to take the Fallen Ones to Glendan.

00:10:46.771 --> 00:10:49.733
That makes us superfluous.

00:10:49.733 --> 00:10:51.067
I see.

00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:56.781
So the Salinban Mercenary Training Group
shall end its mission.

00:10:56.781 --> 00:10:58.408
And?

00:10:59.075 --> 00:11:02.787
I'd like to settle this before I bow out.

00:11:03.038 --> 00:11:04.664
Saya!

00:11:09.002 --> 00:11:10.378
Gedosh!

00:11:10.378 --> 00:11:12.630
Gedosh! Gedosh!

00:11:17.886 --> 00:11:20.305
You'll be assimilated, too.

00:11:20.305 --> 00:11:24.267
I'll take your pretty face,
just like the others.

00:11:24.267 --> 00:11:26.019
I don't think so.

00:11:26.019 --> 00:11:26.895
What?!

00:11:26.895 --> 00:11:29.439
Saya, you stay here and hold down the fort,

00:11:29.439 --> 00:11:31.691
and I'll go and give them what for. Okay?

00:11:31.691 --> 00:11:34.819
I'm the one who does the assimilating, not Saya.

00:11:34.819 --> 00:11:37.947
It's my business, not hers. Understood?

00:11:37.947 --> 00:11:39.657
Where the hell are you?!

00:12:06.142 --> 00:12:08.478
Whoa. Gorneo did, huh?

00:12:08.478 --> 00:12:09.104
Yes.

00:12:09.104 --> 00:12:11.523
That shows how serious he is.

00:12:11.523 --> 00:12:15.151
We can't lose this next intermunicipal battle...

00:12:15.944 --> 00:12:17.362
We can win!

00:12:17.904 --> 00:12:19.322
For sure.

00:12:20.407 --> 00:12:22.158
Yeah. We'll win.

00:12:24.703 --> 00:12:29.541
Cuz we got <i>you</i>!
I believe we can win this no problem!

00:12:29.541 --> 00:12:32.585
Even if you intend to rely on
others to that extent, don't say it!

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:34.004
Are you without shame?

00:12:34.004 --> 00:12:35.922
Shameless since the day I was born.

00:12:35.922 --> 00:12:36.673
I believe it.

00:12:36.673 --> 00:12:38.299
Hey, dammit!

00:12:39.884 --> 00:12:41.803
What is amusing?

00:12:43.763 --> 00:12:45.181
Senior Felli?

00:12:45.181 --> 00:12:49.477
What is amusing about relying
on the strength of another?

00:12:49.477 --> 00:12:50.729
Please explain.

00:12:50.729 --> 00:12:52.313
Uh, well...

00:12:52.313 --> 00:12:55.859
Felli, it's not as if we
meant everything we said.

00:12:55.859 --> 00:12:59.070
No. That was a careless thing
to say in a situation like this.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:03.742
It's as you said. Felli, I'm sorry.

00:13:06.953 --> 00:13:08.580
Senior!

00:13:21.384 --> 00:13:23.511
Senior! Senior!

00:13:23.511 --> 00:13:25.305
Felli!

00:13:25.305 --> 00:13:29.601
Senior Sharnid's the type
who'd say something like that. But...

00:13:29.601 --> 00:13:32.312
I care nothing about that.

00:13:33.146 --> 00:13:38.193
It's her... Why is our leader so composed?

00:13:38.193 --> 00:13:41.738
Does she not know how much we worried?

00:13:41.738 --> 00:13:44.074
How you...

00:13:44.074 --> 00:13:44.824
Fon-Fon!

00:13:44.824 --> 00:13:45.492
Ma'am!

00:13:45.492 --> 00:13:51.373
Why won't she say anything?
Do you really think nothing of that?

00:13:51.373 --> 00:13:54.167
I... I believe in her.

00:13:57.629 --> 00:13:59.714
I understand how you feel, Felli.

00:13:59.714 --> 00:14:03.593
But that was rude to Senior Sharnid
and the others earlier.

00:14:03.593 --> 00:14:04.844
You should hurry and apologize so--

00:14:04.844 --> 00:14:06.054
No.

00:14:21.945 --> 00:14:25.323
<i>Simply by her return, he is so...</i>

00:14:33.039 --> 00:14:34.249
Idiot!

00:14:34.249 --> 00:14:38.169
Idiot, idiot, idiot, idiot, idiot, idiot, idiot!

00:14:47.303 --> 00:14:48.888
We're sure of this?

00:14:48.888 --> 00:14:53.643
Yes. The nen'i operators
discovered the city heading toward us.

00:14:53.643 --> 00:14:56.521
Has the name of that city been confirmed?

00:14:56.521 --> 00:14:59.649
Yes. It's an academic city...

00:14:59.649 --> 00:15:01.067
Myath.

00:15:06.906 --> 00:15:08.616
Myath?

00:15:08.616 --> 00:15:09.909
Have you heard of it?

00:15:09.909 --> 00:15:11.369
It's new to me.

00:15:11.369 --> 00:15:13.496
The names of cities with good battle records

00:15:13.496 --> 00:15:15.707
naturally become known, but...

00:15:16.791 --> 00:15:18.335
What is it, Layfon?

00:15:18.335 --> 00:15:20.170
Oh, it's nothing.

00:15:20.879 --> 00:15:23.256
It doesn't look like Senior Felli's here.

00:15:23.256 --> 00:15:25.300
Now that you mention it, I haven't seen her.

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.344
Gor! We're taking them on, right?

00:15:27.344 --> 00:15:29.346
Ow ow ow!

00:15:29.346 --> 00:15:30.972
Myath.

00:15:38.605 --> 00:15:39.522
Wanna see?

00:15:39.522 --> 00:15:41.149
Ah, thanks.

00:15:46.988 --> 00:15:49.574
Is that... a roaming bus?

00:15:53.703 --> 00:16:01.086
The bus has left Myath and is
currently traveling 50 kilmels/hr.

00:16:01.086 --> 00:16:02.712
The next stop is...

00:16:02.712 --> 00:16:06.383
the academic city Zuellni.

00:16:06.383 --> 00:16:07.926
The route to Zuellni is favorable,

00:16:07.926 --> 00:16:10.095
--with no reports of obstacles or other dangers.
--Looks like we'll get there faster than I thought.

00:16:10.095 --> 00:16:13.640
--with no reports of obstacles or other dangers.
--It's come closer sooner than planned.

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:15.684
Zuellni.

00:16:15.684 --> 00:16:18.520
Looks like it's in the same
direction as the setting sun.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.938
That's...

00:16:19.938 --> 00:16:21.231
Yes.

00:16:22.107 --> 00:16:23.525
Zuellni.

00:16:23.525 --> 00:16:25.944
Layfon is there...

00:16:29.072 --> 00:16:32.075
I'd like you to get this to Layfon.

00:16:33.702 --> 00:16:40.417
I prepared this as proof of having
received all Saiharden techniques.

00:16:40.417 --> 00:16:43.128
I'm to give this... to Layfon?

00:16:54.305 --> 00:16:58.143
We've already set up command HQ
in the student council room.

00:16:58.143 --> 00:17:00.562
We are beginning startup prep
of the municipal defense system

00:17:00.562 --> 00:17:03.773
and a final check of the shelters.

00:17:03.773 --> 00:17:06.151
Will this really be an intermunicipal battle?

00:17:06.151 --> 00:17:09.029
There can be little doubt!

00:17:09.029 --> 00:17:11.906
All platoon members,
stand by in the military training hall

00:17:11.906 --> 00:17:14.617
until otherwise ordered. Dismissed!

00:17:14.617 --> 00:17:15.618
Sir!

00:17:15.618 --> 00:17:17.662
All platoon members on standby, please head to

00:17:17.662 --> 00:17:21.416
your individual waiting rooms
and refrain from undue egress.

00:17:21.416 --> 00:17:23.293
I repeat...

00:17:23.293 --> 00:17:26.671
There's a problem with the fire shutter
in the 6th Platoon's waiting room. Fix it now!

00:17:26.671 --> 00:17:28.548
Distribution of portable meds is running late!

00:17:28.548 --> 00:17:30.383
Rescue squads are to assemble
in the student council building!

00:17:30.383 --> 00:17:32.802
The architectural department's
shelter switched locations, right?

00:17:52.447 --> 00:17:53.865
This is...

00:18:08.463 --> 00:18:10.465
Things've gotten interesting.

00:18:14.094 --> 00:18:15.387
Felli Loss?!

00:18:15.387 --> 00:18:18.139
Yes. She's been abducted by the
Salinban Mercenary Training Group.

00:18:18.139 --> 00:18:19.766
By Haia.

00:18:21.184 --> 00:18:22.435
And?

00:18:22.435 --> 00:18:25.980
Haia wants a one-on-one fight with Layfon.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.942
He says to come alone
tomorrow, to a place he will name.

00:18:28.942 --> 00:18:30.985
And the mercenaries' roaming bus?

00:18:30.985 --> 00:18:34.280
They're not at our
designated lodging facilities.

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:37.367
They appear to be hiding
somewhere beyond the outer border.

00:18:37.367 --> 00:18:39.244
Of all times!

00:18:39.244 --> 00:18:45.834
Mr. President, Sir,
please allow me to have Layfon rescue Felli.

00:18:45.834 --> 00:18:48.753
It can't be helped.

00:18:48.753 --> 00:18:51.339
Myath is before us, approaching.

00:18:51.339 --> 00:18:54.217
What do you plan to do
if the intermunicipal battle starts

00:18:54.217 --> 00:18:55.343
before your rescue is complete?

00:18:55.343 --> 00:18:56.302
Kalian!

00:18:56.302 --> 00:19:00.765
We will make up for Layfon and Felli's absence.

00:19:00.765 --> 00:19:02.934
I don't think a platoon without its nen'i operator

00:19:02.934 --> 00:19:05.812
would be able to perform satisfactorily.

00:19:05.812 --> 00:19:06.896
Even so!

00:19:06.896 --> 00:19:08.189
We will do it!

00:19:08.189 --> 00:19:09.816
How?

00:19:09.816 --> 00:19:13.028
Are you saying you have
some concrete strategy?

00:19:13.028 --> 00:19:14.821
Well...

00:19:14.821 --> 00:19:16.614
Kalian!

00:19:16.614 --> 00:19:17.824
I...

00:19:18.533 --> 00:19:22.662
I will save her. Not just Senior Felli...

00:19:22.662 --> 00:19:24.497
but Zuellni, too.

00:19:26.291 --> 00:19:27.917
Layfon...

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:38.386
Excuse me.

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:47.771
Vanzeh. Redraw our strategies...

00:19:47.771 --> 00:19:51.733
such that Zuellni can
win even without Layfon-<i>kun</i>.

00:19:52.525 --> 00:19:53.943
Sir!

00:19:55.695 --> 00:19:58.073
Right now, he...

00:19:58.073 --> 00:20:01.743
Layfon Alseif cannot be stopped.

00:20:01.743 --> 00:20:03.953
Not by anyone.

00:20:42.117 --> 00:20:45.412
<i>So this is Zuellni.</i>

00:20:45.412 --> 00:20:49.582
<i>Layfon is somewhere in this city right now...</i>

00:20:51.668 --> 00:20:53.044
Here. Your baggage.

00:20:53.044 --> 00:20:54.421
Oh, yes!

00:20:54.421 --> 00:20:56.923
If you'll excuse me.

00:20:56.923 --> 00:20:59.009
Thank you very much.

00:20:59.009 --> 00:21:01.886
Not at all. I'm pleased to
have fulfilled my promise...

00:21:01.886 --> 00:21:04.389
to Shinora-<i>san</i>, that is.

00:21:04.389 --> 00:21:06.224
Shinora-<i>san</i>?

00:21:08.309 --> 00:21:10.061
Ten million points!

00:21:12.772 --> 00:21:15.025
There's no way she'd be here.

00:21:15.025 --> 00:21:20.363
Shinora-<i>san </i>is the one
who asked you to look after me?

00:21:20.363 --> 00:21:22.866
Why? Why would she...?

00:21:22.866 --> 00:21:25.827
I'm very sorry, but I'm in a hurry.

00:21:25.827 --> 00:21:28.496
You will know that answer soon enough.

00:21:30.165 --> 00:21:32.751
Savalis-<i>san</i>!

00:21:34.002 --> 00:21:35.920
Sunrise.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.922
It's almost time.

00:21:42.927 --> 00:21:45.513
Felli... Layfon...

00:22:07.577 --> 00:22:10.205
Things have become troublesome.

00:22:26.262 --> 00:22:36.356
<i>Haikei, anata wa dare o omotteimasu ka</i>

00:22:36.356 --> 00:22:43.446
<i>Kono tegami wa mada mune no naka</i>

00:22:43.446 --> 00:22:53.498
<i>Totsuzen fureta anata no kioku no kakera</i>

00:22:53.498 --> 00:23:00.588
<i>Kokoro ni sasatte, ugokenai</i>

00:23:00.588 --> 00:23:05.427
<i>Kizuite hoshii, kizukanaide</i>

00:23:05.427 --> 00:23:09.139
<i>Tsumetaku suru no wa koi no sei? </i>

00:23:09.139 --> 00:23:18.732
<i>Tsutaetai yo, soba ni ite yo, demo ienai</i>

00:23:19.524 --> 00:23:28.116
<i>Yogoreta kono sekai de anata ni deaeta yo</i>

00:23:28.116 --> 00:23:39.294
<i>Watashi no kokoro ni maiorita</i>
<i>kiseki kanadete kudasai</i>

00:23:39.294 --> 00:23:47.135
<i>Ai no Zuellni</i>

00:23:53.767 --> 00:23:55.643
<i>Felli has been taken hostage,</i>

00:23:55.643 --> 00:23:57.687
<i>and Layfon agrees to a</i>
<i>one-on-one duel with Haia.</i>

00:23:57.687 --> 00:23:59.522
<i>But Haia is of the same Saiharden style,</i>

00:23:59.522 --> 00:24:01.441
<i>and uses the style's</i>
<i>signature single-edged sword,</i>

00:24:01.441 --> 00:24:04.402
<i>giving Layfon a far greater</i>
<i>battle than he had imagined.</i>

00:24:04.402 --> 00:24:06.071
<i>Next time, "Felli, Kidnapped" and...</i>

00:24:06.071 --> 00:24:08.128
<i>Restoration!</i>
